        "description": "Use this tool when the user asks how to reset or change their password. It returns the company's official password reset steps.",
        "jsCode": "return \"Official password reset steps: 1. Go to portal.examplecorp.com/login. 2. Click Forgot password. 3. Enter your work email. 4. Open the reset email within 15 minutes. 5. Set a new password with at least 12 characters.\";"
